# Oracle: VD cmd-sweep (sweep + op is one result over the grid; the last sweep is the inner
# axis; the name names the swept vector); A22 (DcAxis gains an optional name).
# marker: pending A22's DcAxis name (the run owner); the expected text below states the name
# as `name=` after each axis's target, a guess at that syntax.
# codes:
file "sweep_op.sim" deck
  title "sweeps before an op"
  analysis dc name=dc1 (device_param v2 dc) name=vd (list values=[0i, 1i]) (device_param v1 dc) name=vg (lin start=1i stop=3i step=0.5)
